//Fate Spirit Dialogue for summoning Clara
@0 /*Charname*/ = ~Bring me Clara, the Shadowdancer.~

//if you rescued her before
@1 /*Clara*/ = ~Hey, <CHARNAME>, it's you who summoned the noble Caroline Louisa Audrey Rosanna Alexandra...~
@2 /*Player*/ = ~Alright, Clara, this is my own Pocket Plane, and everyone here is a friend. I called you because I want you to join my party.~
@3 /*Player*/ = ~Enough – all you need to know is that you need to rejoin the team.~
@4 /*Player*/ = ~I need your strength on my journey, Caroline. Please help me.~
@5 /*Player*/ = ~Sorry, Clara. I changed my mind. Just wait here for now.~
@6 /*Clara*/ = ~Alright, <CHARNAME>, since you've called me, what else can I do? Let's get started.~
@7 /*Clara*/ = ~Direct and to the point as ever, <CHARNAME>. But that's why I like you. Let's go!~
@8 /*Clara*/ = ~Oh, <CHARNAME>, I'm very happy to be your help. Let's continue the journey.~
@9 /*Clara*/ = ~You're just going to leave me here? That's not very nice.~
@10 /*Clara*/ = ~Alright, I'll wait. It doesn't look like I have much other choice.~

//if you didn't rescue her before
@11 /*Clara*/ = ~What? Where am I? Who are you? You look familiar but I can't really remember... it all feels like a bad dream.~
@12 /*Player*/ = ~Congratulations on joining the party. I hope you have some useful skills.~
@13 /*Player*/ = ~We traveled together briefly and I need your help again.~
@14 /*Player*/ = ~I don't know what I was thinking. I'll summon someone else.~
@15 /*Clara*/ = ~I mean, I guess so. I'm so confused.~
@17 /*Clara*/ = ~It was <CHARNAME>, wasn't it? I think I do remember. Maybe you can tell me more.~
@18 /*Clara*/ = ~You're just going to leave me here? That's not very nice.~

//When she's waiting and hasn't joined you before
@20 /*Clara*/ = ~Oh, <CHARNAME>. You're back. Can I travel with you now?~
@21 /*Player*/ = ~Yes, Clara. Come with me.~
@22 /*Player*/ = ~Sorry. I don't need you yet.~
@23 /*Clara*/ = ~You're serious? Oh, thank god. Let's get out of here.~
@24 /*Clara*/ = ~Seriously? Fine then. Just leave me here to starve.~